Package: uptime-kuma
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: node20, libgcc1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Silens Wong <silenseek14@gmail.com>
Description: Uptime Kuma @VERSION@ (server, dist and node_modules)
 Self-hosted monitoring tool. The package carries the backend, the official
 prebuilt frontend dist and a production node_modules tree, so nothing is
 downloaded on the device.  Runs with the node20 package; the sqlite3 N-API
 addon is the upstream linux-arm64-musl prebuild and libstdc++.so.6 is
 bundled, so no libstdcpp6 dependency is required.
